{"campaign_version":"storage-taxonomy-v2-20260813","canonical":{"bri_country":"Yes","category":"综合能源","country":"阿联酋","country_iso":"ARE","created_at":"2026-03-23T09:59:03.003121","excluded":0,"excluded_reason":null,"id":"ARE-HB-0002","ldc":"No","location":"阿布扎比","location_norm":null,"name_en_quality":"ai_translated","project_name":"阿联酋阿布扎比5.2GW光伏+19GWh储能项目","project_name_en":"Abu Dhabi 5.2GW PV + 19GWh BESS Project","subcategory":"光储"},"events":[{"articles":[{"author":"北极星太阳能光伏网","content":"近日，阿布扎比未来能源公司Masdar宣布，公司与阿联酋水电公司EWEC合作建造全球首个“全天候”超大型光储设施。\n据悉，该项目位于阿布扎比沙漠，占地90平方公里。项目总投资60亿美元，将建设5.2GW的光伏和19GWh的储能电站。建成后，该项目将成为全球首个全天候大型发电项目，而且是全球首个7天24小时全天候连续运行的光伏储能项目，每天可以实现1GW的可再生能源电力的连续供应，预计2027年投入运营。\nMasdar在阿布扎比可持续发展周（ADSW）上宣布，晶科能源、晶澳科技是光伏组件的首选供应商，将各自提供2.6GW光伏组件，两家公司均采用最新的TOPCon技术，并优化了参数，以确保30年的最高效率和产量。\n宁德时代作为BESS的首选供应商，将提供其领先的TENER技术，总容量为19吉瓦时。\n此外，该项目的首选EPC承包商有两家，其中之一为中国电建，另一家则是印度承包商Larsen&Toubro。","content_sha256":"d325d43c9ac32cb16b7109b6c2587626fc1f3fdc6671d236a4ef05fcef12efe5","id":4976,"publish_date":"2025-01-20 22:33:03","title":"60亿美元超大型光储项目，4家中国企业参与","title_sha256":"ef317c2361832e457e5980f2204ab0f5c062d20876faae21d48cf103b7689e89","url":"https://news.goalfore.cn/topstories/detail/77815.html"}],"event":{"additional_remarks":"","canonical_id":"ARE-HB-0002","capacity_details":"PV: 5.2GW, BESS: 19GWh","capacity_mw":5200.0,"capacity_mw_raw":"5200","capacity_source":"legacy","contract_amount_usd":null,"contract_amount_usd_raw":null,"created_at":"2026-03-23T09:59:03.003447","financing_amount_usd":null,"financing_amount_usd_raw":null,"financing_model":"Unknown","financing_model_details":"","id":"ARE-HB-0002-01","investment_date":"","line_length_km":null,"needs_manual_review":0,"non_official_website_links":"[]","official_website_links":"[\"https://www.powerchina-intl.com/show/9/4461.html\"]","planned_complete_date":"","planned_start_date":"","production_capacity_unit":null,"production_capacity_value":null,"project_developer":"阿布扎比未来能源公司; 阿联酋水电公司","project_developer_en":"